        "path_or_url": "export.md",
        "section": "Bundle export",
        "snippet": "# Bundle export\n\nThese rules govern daily bundles consumed by harbour analysts.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "806f5b49825b0e46400bfbf9c152678d9289e050a709c1d3645057da8f9cb9be",
        "project_identity": "local:66cdb3b754c2793c25c80253f7d167886b8a34ae949a9f0fdf86875a48ce4869",
        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 4,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/ad1175dec7791d4a8845a66f"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-62f2717d40c70c2c1d245a9a",
        "path_or_url": "export.md",
        "section": "Bundle export > Publication",
        "snippet": "## Publication\n\nPublish a bundle only when every included station has a verified daily checksum. Include the observation timezone in the manifest. A missing station must be listed explicitly as missing rather than represented by zero water levels.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "4462366a8f2a4f7d9c3e4977ff4ee9191226e1760b5150c082e89daba6c1967c",
        "project_identity": "local:66cdb3b754c2793c25c80253f7d167886b8a34ae949a9f0fdf86875a48ce4869",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 8,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
        "scope": "project",
        "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/63091a52f135895dfed67627"
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-1b4254ea57f601408588a3a0",
        "path_or_url": "export.md",
        "section": "Bundle export > Late observations",
        "snippet": "## Late observations\n\nA late observation creates a new bundle revision; never overwrite an already published bundle. Keep the previous revision addressable for existing citations.\n\n",
        "version_binding": "unversioned",
        "content_sha256": "ec79c2e7ea4214a301ac18da79f018feb6704574da96384a0afd9ec2cdd28875",
        "project_identity": "local:66cdb3b754c2793c25c80253f7d167886b8a34ae949a9f0fdf86875a48ce4869",
        "line_start": 9,
        "line_end": 12,
        "authority": "source_of_truth",
